From c6f3635d72ab7d8d3d1b3dc02cec328f85288b32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Travis Fiorito <travis@sandstorm.chat>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:30:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(octo): keep Octo's radio playlists downloaded as a
 rotating temporary cache

Octo's generated radio playlists (coverArt octo-radio) are kept next to the playlists the user chose,
previews included; what rotates out of them is released by the existing pin reconciler.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
